    <string name="layout_the_450nk_display_is_not_223526d" formatted="false">The 450NK display is not touch. Handlebar play/pause and track buttons work when the selected app supports Bluetooth media controls; they cannot operate every touch-only screen.</string>
    <string name="layout_the_dash_sends_the_handlebar_23559a3" formatted="false">The dash sends the handlebar volume/track/call buttons over Bluetooth — not the mirroring link. Pair your phone to the bike (as a phone/audio device) and they control Android Auto media and calls.</string>
    <string name="layout_the_rotary_knob_steps_through_4d7e7b2" formatted="false">The rotary knob steps through lists; the arrows jump between areas. Works only while Android Auto is projecting. Use Fullscreen while riding — the phone stays awake.</string>
