    <string name="layout_turn_on_for_a_touch_9a62e6c" formatted="false">Turn On for a touch panel on a focus/knob profile (e.g. 1000 MT‑X): Android Auto advertises a touchscreen so you can tap the dash. Turns off Disable touchscreen. Unlock the bike\'s own touch lock if needed. Applies next Connect — Stop first if you\'re already projecting.</string>
    <string name="layout_turn_on_if_handlebar_buttons_43d99bc" formatted="false">Turn On if handlebar buttons do nothing: Android Auto runs in focus/knob mode (no touchscreen advertised) so ▲/▼/Enter work. Needed next Connect — Stop first if you\'re already projecting.</string>
